# Decisions log

Append-only. Never edit or delete an entry; reverse a decision with a new entry that says
`Supersedes: D-NNN`. Agents: decisions here are binding — do not re-open them in a ticket.

Format:

```
## D-001 — <short decision title> (YYYY-MM-DD)
Context: <why this came up, in 1-3 lines>
Decision: <what was decided, precisely>
Alternatives rejected: <option — why not>; <option — why not>
Decided by: <user / supervisor / both>
Supersedes: — | D-NNN
```

